# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF line endings, on Linux, WSL and Windows alike
# (a Windows editor or Python that writes CRLF no longer turns a small edit into a whole-file diff).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte for byte as generated: their SHA-256 is recorded elsewhere (run.json keeps the hash of the
# dataset manifest), so git must never rewrite their line endings.
manifests/** -text
*.zip binary
